name:Run_CBRFC_Ensemble_Fcst_RFC
owner:eorozcowhitaker
description:This MRM Configuration uses each of the ensemble traces from the CBRFC's inflow forecast for the basin one at a time to drive a run of the MTOM.  It then sends selected ouput to a spreadsheet for viewing and statistical analysis. - sc 12/20/11
